name: framing
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a measurement artifact's reference frame changed — the
  denominator, baseline, or ordering a report is expressed in. Fires
  when the same numbers would read differently only because the
  yardstick's orientation flipped (e.g. ratios re-denominated from
  Koru-versus-Zig to other-versus-Koru). The measured value is
  unchanged; what changed is who the table treats as normal.
